arcana-aura-action-name = Arcana Aura
arcana-aura-action-desc = Reveal or hide your enchanting aura.

arcana-aura-enabled = You reveal your aura.
arcana-aura-disabled = You hide your aura.

arcana-aura-message-1 = You sense a fairytale-sweet aroma.
arcana-aura-message-2 = A delicate scent of vanilla and warm sugar drifts through the air.
arcana-aura-message-3 = You are brushed by a faint feeling of gentle magic.
arcana-aura-message-4 = A subtle, spiced-sweet trail lingers nearby.
arcana-aura-message-5 = The air grows softer and warmer, as if an unseen fairytale is shimmering nearby.
arcana-aura-message-6 = A faint tingle runs across your skin, like a small wave of magic passing through.
arcana-aura-message-7 = For a moment, the light around you feels gentler.
arcana-aura-message-8 = A strange, comforting presence settles nearby.
arcana-aura-message-9 = The air trembles softly, leaving a sense of sweet anticipation.
arcana-aura-message-10 = For a heartbeat, the world feels brighter, softer, and a little more enchanted.
arcana-aura-message-11 = A warm, captivating calm spreads through the air.
arcana-aura-message-12 = You feel a barely audible whisper of magic somewhere close.
